  "thig1.2:0.3": "2. Muttātherīgāthā 2. ",
  "thig1.2:1.1": "‘‘Mutte muccassu yogehi, ",
  "thig1.2:1.2": "cando rāhuggahā iva; ",
  "thig1.2:1.3": "Vippamuttena cittena, ",
  "thig1.2:1.4": "anaṇā bhuñja piṇḍaka’’nti. ",
  "thig1.2:2.1": "Itthaṃ sudaṃ bhagavā muttaṃ sikkhamānaṃ imāya gāthāya abhiṇhaṃ ovadatīti. "
}
